{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0005": "$X/S$", "MATH_0006": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-relatively-very-ample-separated}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:fb969b1e81a342aabb975a01ab2e11c33de79117b5e2faacfcde0a882e912780", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ce1b19809dfb5eaafd14a9ad7eb013e05e4e80a3994440f69d8fcd4f6e61a95d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an invertible sheaf on <MATH_0003>.\nIf <MATH_0004> is relatively very ample on <MATH_0005> then\n<MATH_0006> is separated.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b0c40c46826a373f4e7069dae8913d3f37e08e9edaf89ab1a046bf33dae4bbc4", "unit_id": "tag:01VQ:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01VL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{schemes-section-separation-axioms}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-immersions-monomorphisms}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-proj-separated}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d2cdd54c91172842da7935e351b2e537dfc65808da525fec53dd82898c278104", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5a3572e9e5a18e140c0e71ec09f369b4d8a59e36e824cfb6dc2c9333b5a28f09", "source_text": "Being separated is local on the base (see\nSchemes, Section <REF_0001>).\nAn immersion is separated\n(see Schemes, Lemma <REF_0002>).\nHence the lemma follows since locally <MATH_0001> has an immersion into\nthe homogeneous spectrum of a graded ring which is separated, see\nConstructions, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:aebb8cea0572f671789bfb896026283a5bc34f64d6726bbf634ba2b2a51fd228", "unit_id": "tag:01VQ:proof"}
